  {
   "id": "moisture_run_step20_short_grass_dry_air",
   "description": "Reference: NCAR fire_behavior (develop @ eb77580, default real32 build, gfortran 13.3 -O2 in the EqWeFiC container) running its test7 case (80x80 fire cells of 25 m, dt = 0.5 s, num_tiles = 1), dumped in-model by the ctessum-claude/fire_behavior fork (branch earthsciml-instrumented, c9dda02, -DESM_DUMP=ON; summary output bit-identical to the uninstrumented build). Single-precision source: rel 1e-5 (CLAUDE.md contract), abs 1e-7 where a value is exactly 0 or 1. Regime: moisture run (namelist fmoist_run = .true., fmoist_freq = 1: the moisture model advances every 0.5 s step), fmc dump at step 20, cell (i,j) = (40, 40) (Anderson category 1); dry, hot afternoon air (rh 0.08-0.11, T 310-320 K), no rain, so every class is in the drying branch with change = dt rlag << TOL (2nd-order Taylor step); the dead classes sit at the drying equilibrium, the live class relaxes from 0.30 with its 1e9 h lag. Class inputs (fmc_gc before the step) and the category's class weights (fmc_avg dump) are injected as fmc_class-shaped fields.",
   "inputs": "/projects/illinois/eng/cee/ctessum/ctessum/data/eqwefic/dumps/fire/run_fmc/esm_dump_fmc_20.json",
